<% content_for :meta_title, "SMB Automation, Rails, and Shopify Consultant | Doug Morgen" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "Doug Morgen helps SMBs, founders, and e-commerce teams automate manual work, build Rails and Shopify tools, connect APIs, and clean up operations." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="rise-in">
        <p class="pill">Automation + practical software</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">I build the software your business actually needs.</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">I help SMBs, founders, and e-commerce teams replace messy manual work with software their teams can actually use.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">That might mean automating operations, building Rails or Shopify tools, connecting APIs, cleaning up data, or helping you make a technical decision without turning it into a whole production.</p>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <%= link_to "See how I can help", services_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
          <%= link_to "See past work", work_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
        </div>

        <div class="proof-grid mt-8">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Best for</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">SMBs and operators</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Common work</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Automation, Rails, Shopify</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Engagement</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Project, retainer, or tech lead</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rise-in">
        <%= render "inquiries/quick_form", anchor_id: "quick-fit-check", intro: "Tell me what you want to build, automate, or fix. I will send next steps." %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block pt-0">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Automate day-to-day work</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Turn recurring spreadsheet tasks, approvals, and handoffs into tools your team can trust every day.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Build Rails and Shopify tools</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Rails apps, Shopify workflows, admin screens, reports, fulfillment logic, and the code that keeps operations moving.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Make technical calls clearer</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Get senior help with architecture, vendors, scope, or roadmap choices when the business needs a straight answer.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-block bg-slate-50/80">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="card border-slate-200 bg-white">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Reasons people reach out</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <ul class="proof-list text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>Your team is doing important work in spreadsheets, email, or too many admin screens.</li>
          <li>Your Shopify, fulfillment, accounting, or customer systems do not stay in sync.</li>
          <li>Your Rails app matters to the business, but shipping has slowed down.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="proof-list text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>You need a senior technical person who understands operations.</li>
          <li>You want cleaner reporting and more confidence in your data.</li>
          <li>You want useful software shipped, not a month of vague discovery.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <%= link_to "Explore services", services_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
        <%= link_to "Read the FAQ", faq_path, class: "btn-secondary" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
